{"language":"jp","values":[["/names/cn","太一与亚古兽"],["/names/jp","太一&アグモン"],["/description_i18n/cn","太一是拥有优秀的领导力和行动力的小学五年级学生，持有勇气徽章。亚古兽是他的搭档数码宝贝，总是充满活力。"],["/description_i18n/jp","太一はリーダーシップと行動力に優れた小学5年生。勇気の紋章を持っている。アグモンは元気いっぱいの太一のパートナーデジモン。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","行くぞアグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","行くぞアグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"行くぞアグモン！","text":"上吧，亚古兽！","target_transcript":"行くぞアグモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"行くぞアグモン！","text":"Let's go, Agumon!","target_transcript":"行くぞアグモン!","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","text":"亚古兽变得更强了。","target_transcript":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","text":"Agumon just got even stronger.","target_transcript":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/jp","アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！","text":"亚古兽跃迁进化！战斗暴龙兽！","target_transcript":"アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/2/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！","text":"Agumon, warp digivolve to... WarGreymon!","target_transcript":"アグモンワープ進化! ウォーグレイモン!","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","うわ、グレイモン。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/jp","うわ、グレイモン。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"うわ、グレイモン。","text":"啊，暴龙兽……","target_transcript":"うわ、グレイモン。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/3/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"うわ、グレイモン。","text":"Ah... Greymon...","target_transcript":"うわ、グレイモン.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/cn","よーしやったぞー！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/jp","よーしやったぞー！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"よーしやったぞー！","text":"好，成功了！","target_transcript":"よーしやったぞー！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/4/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"よーしやったぞー！","text":"All right, we did it!","target_transcript":"よーしやったぞー!","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/cn","俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/jp","俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。","text":"我和亚古兽会保护大家。","target_transcript":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/5/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。","text":"Agumon and I will protect everyone.","target_transcript":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","どうだうまいかアグモン。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","どうだうまいかアグモン。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"どうだうまいかアグモン。","text":"怎么样，好吃吗，亚古兽？","target_transcript":"どうだうまいかアグモン。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"どうだうまいかアグモン。","text":"How is it, Agumon? Tasty?","target_transcript":"どうだうまいかアグモン.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。","text":"这是我画的亚古兽。怎么样，画得很像吧？","target_transcript":"俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。","text":"That's my drawing of Agumon. What do you think? Looks just like him, right?","target_transcript":"あれが書いたアグモンだ どうだそっくりだろ.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我喜欢这个，谢谢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/jp","これ、気に入ったよ！ありがとう！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/jp","わっ、ありがとう！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","太一非常擅长踢足球，是御台场小学的王牌射手。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/jp","サッカーが得意な太一は、お台場小学校のサッカークラブのエースストライカーをつとめている。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","太一对画画不太在行。他曾经为辨识方向画过一幅法易路岛的地图，可惜除了他本人外谁都看不懂。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/jp","太一は絵が得意ではない。以前、方角を確かめるためにファイル島の地図を描いたことがあるが、本人以外の誰が見てもわからなかった。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","太一的行动力很强，但并非只是莽撞行事。他能够细致地观察周围情况，从而做出正确的决断。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/jp","太一は行動力があるが、ただの無鉄砲ではない。周囲の状況を細かく観察し、正しい判断を下すことができる。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","在冒险途中，太一曾向大和讨教厨艺，学会了更好吃的蛋包饭烹饪方法。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/jp","冒険の旅の途中で、太一はヤマトに料理を教わり、オムライスをもっとおいしく作れる方法を身につけた。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","太一随身携带着一副单筒望远镜，在冒险途中用于侦察地形、敌情，起到了重要的用处。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/jp","太一は単眼鏡を持ち歩いていて、冒険の途中では地形や敵の様子の偵察に使い、大いに役立てた。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","亚古兽非常贪吃，常常一会儿就肚子饿了。饥饿时，甚至一口气吞下过一整条鱼。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/jp","食いしん坊んなアグモンは、しょっちゅうお腹をすかせており、空腹で魚を一匹丸呑みしたこともある。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","太一曾经因为过于焦躁想让亚古兽进化，导致亚古兽错误地进化为了丧尸暴龙兽。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/jp","かつて太一は進化を急ぎすぎたせいで、誤ってアグモンをスカルグレイモンに進化させてしまったことがある。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","亚古兽有时也会展现出有些胆小的一面，例如夜晚去洗手间时，曾让太一陪同过。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/jp","アグモンにも臆病なところがある。例えば、夜にトイレに行くとき、太一に付き添ってもらったことがある。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","太一充满勇气。曾经他为了拯救同伴，即使面对流有危险高压电的墙壁，也没有屈服于恐惧。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/jp","太一はとても勇敢な少年だ。かつて彼は仲間を救うため、危険な高圧電流が流れる壁を前にしても、恐怖に屈しなかった。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","当太一发现亚古兽的优点时，他总是会毫不吝啬地给予亚古兽称赞。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/jp","太一はアグモンの長所を見つけたときは、それを褒めることを決して惜しまない。"]]}